		{
			dependencies: ["7461DC1FA0C21CBF"]
			description: [
				"Ars Nouveau is a &lvery &rpowerful mod. Listing all the possible spells would take a full scale guide, you are better of finding that on your own. There are a lot."
				""
				"Some possible goals for spells:"
				""
				"- Mining spell - with a proper spell you can mine out a whole ore vein in minutes;"
				"- Movement spell - something based on Leap would be a decent first step;"
				"- Exchanging spell - Tier 2 spell that can replace large areas of blocks at once, very useful for building;"
				"- Healing spell - free healing just for mana might come in handy."
			]
			id: "16C68448A7ADA9D4"
			subtitle: "Unlimited Power"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0CF9ABBBC4C9573E"
				item: "ars_nouveau:novice_spell_book"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Ars Nouveau"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["16C68448A7ADA9D4"]
			description: [
				"Voids items you pick up. Obviously useful for mining."
				""
				"Shift-RMB to activate/deactivate."
				"Put the item in the offhand, the jar in the main hand and right click to add an item to whitelist of the jar."
			]
			id: "47A0EF68B249BF8C"
			subtitle: "/dank/null"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6A7037D084E94606"
				item: "ars_nouveau:void_jar"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -1.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["16C68448A7ADA9D4"]
			description: [
				"Rituals and Spell Turrets are the main ways of automating stuff with Ars."
				""
				"Rituals can use Tablets to perform different actions in an area."
				"Some notable mentions include:"
				"- Tablet of Harvest - collects crops;"
				"- Tablet of Overgrowth - bone meals crops;"
				"- Tablet of Flight - provides creative flight in its range;"
				"- Tablets of Sunrise and Moonfall - change the time to day or night."
				"Some of the Tablets use Source! Check the tooltips!"
				""
				"Spell Turrets can use any spell you can, but instead of mana they use Source."
				"The range of what you can do is only limited to your imagination! Some useful options, though:"
				"- Wood farming with Fell;"
				"- Accelerating crop growth with Growth;"
				"- Some mining shenanigans, perchance?"
				"Enchanced Spell turret uses half the cost, and is a pretty cheap upgrade."
			]
			id: "32056D9EA2D9FFA3"
			subtitle: "Not A Tech Mod"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "1ACE401325580E90"
					item: "ars_nouveau:ritual_brazier"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "40CD828B03BF531B"
					item: "ars_nouveau:basic_spell_turret"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Ars Automatica"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7461DC1FA0C21CBF"]
			description: [
				"Malum Totems can be used for a wide variety of purposes, you definitely should check out Encyclopedia Arcana for all of them."
				"Main benefit of totems is that they do everything they do for free. No logistics needed. Just an effect, for free, forever!"
				""
				"Some useful examples:"
				"- Rite of Growth - accelerates crop growth significantly;"
				"- Rites of Nourishment and Lust - one feeds the animals, the other forces them to breed... yeah;"
				"- Rite of Loyalty - increases reach;"
				"- Rite of Unwinding - decreases the insomnia timer randomly, basically turning off Phantoms if you place it near your crafting area;"
				""
				"You can use the Totemic Staff to check the area of your rites!"
			]
			id: "4F023F1700156C37"
			subtitle: "Definitely a magic mod"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0AD5A827327FC140"
				item: "malum:runewood_totem_base"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Totemancy"
			x: -3.0d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B4F0BE29E6CD211"]
			description: [
				"There is a dozen different familiars in Occultism, most of which give different effects."
				"You can put them in a Familiar Ring for personal buffs or use them in-world."
				""
				"The most notable ones are:"
				"- Demon - Fire Resistance;"
				"- Bat - Night Vision;"
				"- Greedy - greatly increased item pick up range;"
				"- Drikwig - Multi-jump, Slow Fall and Jump Boost, the closest you'll get to flight for a bit."
				""
				"There definitely are some more niche uses from the rest, like Blacksmith being able to repait items with mere cobblestone, so check all of them out!"
			]
			id: "5E2528D9543066B3"
			subtitle: "Yes, there is a Demon Wife."
			tasks: [{
				id: "5509C0F3E4273141"
