		{
			dependencies: ["7B4F0BE29E6CD211"]
			description: [
				"Main automation tool of Occultism are Foliots. They are entities capable of performing some specific tasks."
				"- Lumberjack - pretty obvious, chops down trees &l(beware, they do not collect special drops, like resin from the Rubber Trees!)&r;"
				"- Janitor - picks up items, useful in pair with Lumberjack, but definitelly more performance intensive than an Item Collector;"
				"- Transporter - move items from place to place."
